"<p><b>3-Gram-matching</b></p>"
"<p>A message matches another if most of its 3-letter groups are contained in "
"the other message. e.g. 'abc123' matches 'abcx123c12'.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p><b>3-Gram-мутобиқӣ</b></p>"
